## 📊 GOOGLE WORKSPACE CLI (GWS)

**Samma kraft som Claude Code + GWS CLI — nu för Jonas dealflow**

### Installera GWS CLI
```bash
brew tap googleworkspace/cli && brew install gws
gws auth login
```

### GWS Commands för Dealflow

```bash
# 📄 Deal Teasers (Google Docs)
gws docs create --title "DEAL-L001 - NordicSaaS"
gws docs update [DOC_ID] --content "Company: NordicSaaS | Revenue: 75M SEK"

# 📊 Lead Pipeline (Google Sheets)
gws sheets create --title "Jonas Dealflow Pipeline 2026"
gws sheets append [SHEET_ID] --values "2026-03-27,NordicSaaS,SaaS,lead,80000"

# 📧 Outreach (Gmail)
gws gmail send --to "vd@saasbolag.se" --subject "Möjlighet för M&A" --body "Hej..."

# 📅 Möten (Calendar)
gws calendar create-event --title "Möte NordicSaaS" --start "2026-03-28T10:00" --duration 30

# 🔍 Läs mer
cat "/Users/jonasthevathason/AI Agents =)/.cursor/skills-cursor/google-workspace-dealflow/SKILL.md"
```

### GWS Skills (Pre-built Recipes)
```bash
gws skills run find-free-time
gws skills run create-report
gws skills run email-from-sheet
```

