## 💰 DEALFLOW PIPELINE (Deal Sourcing)

### Mål
- **200 000 SEK/månad** (Juni 2026)
- **SaaS nisch**, 50M+ SEK omsättning
- **Finder's Fee:** 30-150k SEK/deal
- **Kapitalintroduktion:** 2-5% av rest-kapital

### Startup (Cursor Terminal)
```bash
# Kör Dealflow startup — laddar allt
bash "/Users/jonasthevathason/AI Agents =)/Dealflow-Pipeline/dealflow_startup.sh"

# Eller CLI direkt
cd "/Users/jonasthevathason/AI Agents =)/Dealflow-Pipeline" && python3 dealflow_cli.py status
```

### Deal Commands
```bash
# Lägg till deal
python3 "/Users/jonasthevathason/AI Agents =)/Dealflow-Pipeline/scripts/add_deal.py" \
  --company "Bolagsnamn" --domain "bolag.se" --sector "SaaS" --revenue 75000000

# Uppdatera deal
python3 "/Users/jonasthevathason/AI Agents =)/Dealflow-Pipeline/scripts/update_deal.py" \
  --id L001 --stage teaser --next-action "Skicka teaser"

# Logga outreach
python3 "/Users/jonasthevathason/AI Agents =)/Dealflow-Pipeline/scripts/log_outreach.py" \
  --deal L001 --type email --template cold_intro

# Score client
python3 "/Users/jonasthevathason/AI Agents =)/Dealflow-Pipeline/scripts/score_client.py" \
  --deal L001

# Kör autonomous pipeline
cd "/Users/jonasthevathason/AI Agents =)/Dealflow-Pipeline" && python3 autopilot.py
```

### Dealflow Handoff
```bash
# Läs handover
cat "/Users/jonasthevathason/AI Agents =)/Dealflow-Pipeline/HANDOVER.md"

# Läs pipeline
cat "/Users/jonasthevathason/AI Agents =)/Dealflow-Pipeline/pipeline.md"
```

### Dealflow Filer
```
Dealflow-Pipeline/
├── HANDOVER.md          ← Ladda denna först
├── pipeline.md           ← Deal tracker
├── dealflow_cli.py      ← CLI interface
├── dealflow_startup.sh  ← Startup script
├── deals/targets.json   ← Deal data (14 deals, 867k SEK potential)
├── outreach/sent.json   ← Outreach logg (6 sent)
└── leads/investors.json ← Investerare (7 st)
```

